chapter.v:
“Fear not, 


for you, 


will not be ashamed; be not confounded, for you will not be disgraced; for you will forget the shame of your youth, and the reproach of your widowhood you will remember no more.

Behold, I 


have created, 


the smith who blows the fire of coals and produces a weapon for its purpose. I have also created the ravager to destroy;
